@BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001
# @BASE_URL=

### Get all blogs
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/blogs

### Get all users
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/users

### Create new user
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

