### Login user
# @name login
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lePaul",
  "password": "supersecretpassword"
}

### Create new post
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

